    "document": "docs/adr/0003-the-review-queue-blocks-publication.md",
    "kind": "control",
    "role": "node",
    "tooltip": "**No longer a filter.** It was a gate that silently deleted; it is now a router. Above 0.70, straight through. Below, parked for a human.\n\nThe number is unchanged — what changed is that nothing disappears."
   },
