    "tooltip": "A human, on the critical path, before the open. Drawn as an agent node because the outcome is a judgement, not a computation.\n\nTwo outcomes drawn — promote or reject. If vetting can do something else (adjust the confidence, defer it to tomorrow), those are more arrows."
